 rosé) made from our very own 2024 Sonoma County Rosé https://adoberoadwin
 es.com/product/2024-rose-sonoma-county . We hope you love it!\n\nJoin us 
 every Friday and Saturday to enjoy a glass of frosé or any of our other a
 ward-winning wines in the heart of Petaluma. Whether you’re exploring win
 e country\, planning a weekend outing\, or looking for the best frosé in 
 Sonoma County\, Adobe Road Winery is your go-to destination.\n\nEven bett
 er\, Inside Track Wine Club https://adoberoadwines.com/wine-club/ members
  enjoy additional club member pricing as well.\n\nOur frosé is available 
 on Fridays and Saturdays\, while supplies last. Walk-ins welcome\, reserv
 ations recommended. Call or text (707) 774-6699 or use Tock https://www.e
 xploretock.com/adoberoadwines/ to reserve online.
