SUMMARY: Community Pop-Up
DESCRIPTION:Join Gathering Thyme this Saturday for our next Community Pop
 -Up! Here are some of the highlights of our offerings.\n\n  * 20-minute F
 lower Essence sessions with Catherine "Abby" Rich. Our beloved herbal eld
 er is offering private 20-minute sessions for $36 which includes a person
 alized flower essence formula.\n  * 30-minute Intuitive Readings with Cla
 ire Niemiste. Claire is a gifted Clairvoyant and Intuitive Healer offerin
 g private 30-minute sessions for $50.\n   Walk-ins welcome for Abby or Cl
 aire\, but appointments recommended by calling 415-524-8693\n  * Delectab
 le Chai and Healthy Treats with Chrisandra Fox-Walker. Her chai is an abs
 olute favorite for staff and customers alike! Browse our offerings while 
 sipping a warm cup of non-dairy chai.\n  * Homemade Organic Jams and Herb
 al Bath Bombs from Brittany Bossier. Great gifts for Moms.\n  * Fire Cide
 r and Echinacea/Elderberry Syrup from Dana Hanson. Sales support her nurs
 ing school education!\n  * A Maker's Station with Cheryl Fromholzer. Make
  your own handcrafted tea blend or herbal bath soak for Mom! By donation.
 \n  * Beautiful hand-dyed\, block printed clothing including scarfs\, ves
 ts and saris all graciously donated by Leah Meakin who's late-mother\, Ri
 ta Hope-Cameron Meakin owned "Anokhi\," a clothing store in San Francisco
 . 100% of proceeds from sales of Anokhi clothing benefits our community c
 linic!\n\nCash or Venmo only. These sales go directly to our artisans and
  healers.10% of all sales support our Community Clinic (except for Anokhi
  clothing where 100% of proceeds go directly to the clinic!)\n\n
