SUMMARY: Mother's Day Tea
DESCRIPTION:Honoring Moms and the People Who Love Them\n\nJoin us for a s
 pecial gathering as we celebrate the incredible mothers and mother figure
 s in our lives. Enjoy a delightful afternoon filled with soothing teas\, 
 delicious treats\, and meaningful connection in a warm\, relaxed setting.
 \n\nWhether you come by yourself\, with your mom\, daughter\, spouse\, or
  a cherished mother figure\, you’ll find a welcoming space to slow down\,
  share laughter\, and create sweet memories together. This is a beautiful
  opportunity to show appreciation and celebrate the love that makes mothe
 rhood so special.\n\nWe can’t wait to share this special day with you. Pl
 ease RSVP to the event at: www.mothercaresupport.com/events https://www.m
 othercaresupport.com/events\n\n\nGiving Back\n\nProceeds from this event 
 will benefit Mothers Care Support\, a local nonprofit dedicated to matern
 al mental health. Through community\, education\, and compassionate suppo
 rt\, they uplift new moms and parents during one of life’s most meaningfu
 l\, and sometimes challenging\, chapters.
CATEGORIES:
