SUMMARY: FLAMENCO! LIVE! Saturday May 9th 2026 at The Big Easy ~ Mother's
  Day Show!
DESCRIPTION:Join us for an intoxicating evening of fiery flamenco perform
 ances when FLAMENCO! LIVE! sets the stage on fire with the fury and passi
 on of Spain's legendary Gypsies (Roma) with a\nFlamenco Dinner Show in th
 e intimate atmosphere of THE BIG EASY. EXPERIENCE flamenco as stirring da
 nces\, blazing guitars\, and soulful singing will transport you to anothe
 r place and time.\nFEEL the HEAT...\n\nFLAMENCO!\nLIVE!\nSPECIAL MOTHER'S
  DAY SHOW\n\nSaturday\, May 9th\n2026\n\nClaudia Barros ~ Dancer\nChristi
 na Zanfagna ~ Dancer\nAzriel "El Moreno" ~ Singer\n"La Fibi" ~ Singer\nRi
 cardo Diaz ~ Guitarist\n\nShowtime: 6 pm\nDoors: 5 pm\n$30\nPay at the Do
 or\nCash or Card\n\nat\nThe Big Easy\nClub and Restaurant\n128 American A
 lley\nPetaluma USA\n\n*********************************\nFlamenco Shows e
 very OTHER Month!\nThe 2nd Saturday of the Month.\nAlways different Artis
 ts.\nAlways a different Show.\n\nFlamenco Dinner Show with delicious food
  and a Full Bar are available\, not included in entrance fee.\n\nArrive e
 arly\, get a good table and enjoy the food!\nLine forms at 4:45 pm\n\n*Li
 mited Reservations available for parties of 5 - 6 or more.\nCall at:\n(70
 7) 774- 9072\n\n*Large fully ventilated restaurant\, plenty of room for s
 pacing\, masks optional.\n\nFLAMENCO! LIVE! ﻿was envisioned\, conceived\,
  and has thrived since 2002 in Sonoma County\, California\, now celebrati
 ng 24 years! Presenting the collaborative efforts of the Bay Area's fines
 t Flamenco Singers\, Guitarists and Dancers\, and supporting local Flamen
 co students\, dreamers\, and talents\, our goal has been to present top-n
 otch performances. Phoebe Vernier "La Fibi" has brought decades of artist
 ry and energy to the public of Sonoma County for the purpose of sharing t
 he music\, song and dance\, the treasure of Southern Spain. Whether in th
 e formal theater or in a casual setting\, the respect\, purity\, and inte
 grity of this traditional\, yet living and evolving art form is always fo
 remost.\n\nNow in our 4rd Year of romantic Flamenco Shows!\n\nThis perfor
 mance is underwritten by the generous support of "The Circle of Sponsors"
 \, a group of flamenco music\, song and dance Aficionados from Sonoma Cou
 nty\, California and Nationwide that believe in the power of local art to
  heal and inspire our community and world. Thank you so much\, Sponsors!\
 n\n"Best Performing Dance Company" - The Northbay Bohemian's\nBEST of the
  Northbay!
CATEGORIES:fun-things-to-do-in-Petaluma,flamenco-show,flamenco-dance,flam
 enco-guitar
