SUMMARY: Summer Concert Series – The Beguilers
DESCRIPTION:Theatre District is thrilled to announce the return of its Su
 mmer Concert Series for 2026. Beginning in June and running through Septe
 mber\, the series features free live music every Friday from 6:00 PM to 8
 :00 PM in downtown Petaluma. The concert series brings together local tal
 ent and diverse musical styles\, creating a vibrant community gathering i
 n the heart of the Theatre District.\n\nThe Beguilers https://www.thebegu
 ilers.com/?fbclid=PAZXh0bgNhZW0CMTEAAaeC1hbN_X4YlVlPjcb72m8j2mujlwxgqaTgS
 CkccS-WAHJoPWUX8E_Bv4b3Cg_aem_3jhJCCW6PLwiqL57g3islA are performing from 
 6:00 to 8:00 in Theatre Square. We hope to see you there!\n\nThe Beguiler
 s are a swing jazz quintet based in Sonoma County\, California\, known fo
 r their romantic and timeless renditions of jazz classics from the 1930s 
 to 1960s\, infused with gypsy flavor and French flair. Comprised of Alia 
 Beeton\, Heidi Grainger\, Patrick Kelly\, Dave Russell\, and Chris Miano\
 , the group performs at various venues across the Bay Area\, including wi
 neries\, weddings\, and public events
CATEGORIES:Summer-Concert-Series,Theatre-District,Music,Live-Music
