 vKehJoc9T7vAIUuMRRggaLBMIg\n\nVelvet Shadows are long-time friends that f
 ormed to make fun\, funky versions of their soul favorites. Chelsea handl
 es vocals and bass and Eli plays guitar\, drums\, and produces.\n\nhttps:
 //velvetshadows.bandcamp.com/track/aquarius-2 https://link.commerce7.com/
 ss/c/u001.2r-SKiE-u2BQ0i2el-CoTM_3Xm6axKAYuYmG2GKdr6ztJs_8FW9drNK7fzKNvBJ
 C3iNfhSFxKMNFyjRDtwNC9Kc5JdfCUYYtwODTh_6X4VIeq1v0y7thBY2dOqYOxK-HxwvvREB2
 5foFPibOvhzQkw/4qt/2cdVb3hARRajN8sghhaI3Q/h20/h001.9pCTXigwOqiNkNVkduS2_f
 Lf_8onKbsxsk_-5Ouj4ww\n\nDJ Gamayabreak is a Santa Rosa based DJ who play
 s an eclectic mix of psych\, afrobeat\, brazilian\, jazz\, funk\, and dis
 co exclusively on vinyl. He has performed locally at Bloodroot Winery\, S
 hady Oak Brewing\, and is a regular in the rotation of DJs at Glitter and
  Goth\, a monthly dance club in Santa Rosa.
