SUMMARY: Free Estate Planning Webinar
DESCRIPTION:Creating your estate plan\, whether it’s a living trust or a 
 will\, can be a daunting task. Estate planning addresses issues that are 
 difficult to think about\, such as death\, incapacity\, finances\, and fa
 mily dynamics. It can be easy to procrastinate\, even though these issues
  may weigh heavily on your mind.\n\nWe invite you to attend one of our up
 coming free webinars so you can take the first step toward having peace o
 f mind by creating (or updating) your estate plan. This is an educational
  webinar\, where we highlight some of the concerns that many families fac
 e and how an estate plan can help. The attorneys also break down how will
 s and trusts differ\, and some of the common estate planning pitfalls and
  how to avoid them.
