SUMMARY: Theatre District Summer Concert Series – Ariana LaMark
DESCRIPTION:Theatre District is thrilled to announce the return of its Su
 mmer Concert Series for 2026. Beginning in June and running through Septe
 mber\, the series features free live music every Friday from 6:00 PM to 8
 :00 PM in downtown Petaluma. The concert series brings together local tal
 ent and diverse musical styles\, creating a vibrant community gathering i
 n the heart of the Theatre District.\n\nAriana LaMark https://www.faceboo
 k.com/lamarkariana/ is performing from 6:00 to 8:00 in Theatre Square. We
  hope to see you there!\n\nAriana LaMark is a Northern California–based s
 inger\, songwriter\, and performer known for her smooth blend of contempo
 rary R&B\, pop\, and soul influences. Drawing inspiration from honest sto
 rytelling and emotional experience\, her music explores themes of love\, 
 growth\, and self-reflection\, delivered through warm\, expressive vocals
  and modern production. With a sound that balances vulnerability and stre
 ngth\, Ariana LaMark creates performances that feel both intimate and pow
 erful. Her stage presence is engaging and authentic\, allowing audiences 
 to connect deeply with her music while enjoying an energetic and polished
  live experience.
