SUMMARY: Theatre District Summer Concert Series – Steve Pile Band
DESCRIPTION:Theatre District is thrilled to announce the return of its Su
 mmer Concert Series for 2026. Beginning in June and running through Septe
 mber\, the series features free live music every Friday from 6:00 PM to 8
 :00 PM in downtown Petaluma. The concert series brings together local tal
 ent and diverse musical styles\, creating a vibrant community gathering i
 n the heart of the Theatre District.\n\nSteve Pile Band https://stevepile
 .com/ is performing from 6:00 to 8:00 in Theatre Square. We hope to see y
 ou there!\n\nThe Steve Pile Band\, a fixture in the Petaluma music scene\
 , offers a unique blend of delta blues\, country\, African rhythms\, and 
 jam band influences. Founded by Steve Pile\, a singer-songwriter and guit
 arist\, the band has developed a distinctive sound that combines the trad
 itional with the eclectic. Pile’s musical journey has taken him from Alas
 ka to Austin and even West Africa\, where he incorporated local musical e
 lements into his style. Known for their dynamic performances\, the Steve 
 Pile Band has been a staple at various venues across Northern California\
 , consistently drawing audiences with their compelling mix of original tu
 nes and energetic jams .
CATEGORIES:Summer-Concert-Series,Theatre-District,Music,Live-Music
