SUMMARY: Theatre District Summer Concert Series – Back Porch-Estra
DESCRIPTION:Theatre District is thrilled to announce the return of its Su
 mmer Concert Series for 2026. Beginning in June and running through Septe
 mber\, the series features free live music every Friday from 6:00 PM to 8
 :00 PM in downtown Petaluma. The concert series brings together local tal
 ent and diverse musical styles\, creating a vibrant community gathering i
 n the heart of the Theatre District.\n\nBack Porch-Estra https://www.back
 porchestra.com/ is performing from 6:00 to 8:00 in Theatre Square. We hop
 e to see you there!\n\nBack Porch-Estra in Petaluma is a vibrant musical 
 ensemble that has brought a unique and intimate concert experience to the
  community. Known for performing in unconventional venues such as backyar
 ds\, porches\, and other cozy outdoor settings\, the group has become a c
 herished part of Petaluma’s cultural landscape. Their eclectic repertoire
 \, which blends classical\, jazz\, folk\, and contemporary music\, attrac
 ts a diverse audience and fosters a strong sense of community. By making 
 their performances accessible\, often free or at a low cost\, Back Porch-
 Estra ensures that a wide range of people can enjoy live music in a relax
 ed and informal atmosphere. This innovative approach not only breaks away
  from the traditional concert hall experience but also creates personal c
 onnections between musicians and audiences. Through their creative progra
 mming and collaborative spirit\, Back Porch-Estra in Petaluma continues t
 o enrich the local arts scene and bring people together through the unive
 rsal language of music.
CATEGORIES:Summer-Concert-Series,Theatre-District,Music,Live-Music
